#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:19
msgid "Google Workspace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs — powered by `gws` "
"(Google's official Rust CLI). The skill provides a backward-compatible "
"Python wrapper that handles OAuth token refresh and delegates to `gws`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:23
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:30
msgid ""
"`setup.py` handles OAuth2 (headless-compatible, works on "
"CLI/Telegram/Discord)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:31
msgid ""
"`gws_bridge.py` refreshes the Hermes token and injects it into `gws` via "
"`GOOGLE_WORKSPACE_CLI_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:32
msgid ""
"`google_api.py` provides the same CLI interface as v1 but delegates to "
"`gws`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:34
msgid "References"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/google-workspace_SKILL.md:36
msgid ""
"`references/gmail-search-syntax.md` — Gmail search operators (is:unread, "
"from:, newer_than:, etc.)"
msgstr ""

